 ## `golden.json` schema (v2)

 ```json
 {
   "schema_version": 2,
   "scenarios": [
     {
       "id": "g-receptionist-greeting",
       "user_message": "Hi, I'd like to start an interview.",
       "reference_response": "Hello! I'd be happy to start an interview with you. What role are you preparing for?",
